(534109, 53174, 14952, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of this and it is an incredible shot.  A few things I can suggest:<br/> <br/>The flash in the window is a bit distracting, but this is difficult to avoid when taking against a window.  <br/> <br/>I''m not quite sure why you have included the leaves in the upper right corner.  I fell that these take away from the main image of the flower. <br/> <br/>The flower could be a tiny bit brighter, but then that would likely overexpose the snow in the background.<br/> <br/>I think you did a great job with a very challenging shot, and it fit the challenge perfect.</td>', 'I really like the idea of this and it is an incredible shot.  A few things I can suggest: The flash in the window is a bit distracting, but this is difficult to avoid when taking against a window.   I''m not quite sure why you have included the leaves in the upper right corner.  I fell that these take away from the main image of the flower.  The flower could be a tiny bit brighter, but then that would likely overexpose the snow in the background. I think you did a great job with a very challenging shot, and it fit the challenge perfect.', '2004-01-07 01:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
