(534145, 53957, 8816, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, this shot looks familiar ;-)!  A great technique to make smoke look better is too invert the image!  Makes the smoke black, and background white!! Looks like you needed a faster shutter speed here, and some different lighting. ,I lit directly from the back with about four lamps, one from overtop and one from the side!   I think you should''ve stuck with cigarettes though, cause the incense doesn''t look like a cigar!  Unless I''m just stupid and that''s actually a cigar, and not incense, lol!  A nice attempt, that frist cylinder shape is great!</td>', 'Hmmm, this shot looks familiar ;-)!  A great technique to make smoke look better is too invert the image!  Makes the smoke black, and background white!! Looks like you needed a faster shutter speed here, and some different lighting. ,I lit directly from the back with about four lamps, one from overtop and one from the side!   I think you should''ve stuck with cigarettes though, cause the incense doesn''t look like a cigar!  Unless I''m just stupid and that''s actually a cigar, and not incense, lol!  A nice attempt, that frist cylinder shape is great!', '2004-01-07 01:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
