(534242, 53855, 14863, '<td valign="top">Very cool- like the blue tone</td>', 'Very cool- like the blue tone', '2004-01-07 03:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(534244, 53843, 9809, '<td valign="top">You''ll probably get lots of "The horizon isn''t level" kinds of comments. For me, that''s what gives this photo the extra boost it needs to jump one point. It gives the runner a nice slant as well. I would like to see the same shot, but with the runner in different places -- some with him silhouetted by the sky rather than in front of the large rock. I''m not sure if it would be better that way, but it would be worth a look.</td>', 'You''ll probably get lots of "The horizon isn''t level" kinds of comments. For me, that''s what gives this photo the extra boost it needs to jump one point. It gives the runner a nice slant as well. I would like to see the same shot, but with the runner in different places -- some with him silhouetted by the sky rather than in front of the large rock. I''m not sure if it would be better that way, but it would be worth a look.', '2004-01-07 03:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(534246, 54072, 9809, '<td valign="top">A photo of a photo, isn''t really much of a photo -- I mean, how difficult was the overall composition here?</td>', 'A photo of a photo, isn''t really much of a photo -- I mean, how difficult was the overall composition here?', '2004-01-07 03:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
