(534266, 53925, 15407, '<td valign="top">Photo conveys the theme well ... or does it?  Vegan, Health food, recent downsizing at work... more likey weight loss.  The can being the obtuse focal point within the s the photo is the give away for ''diet''... How it may have changed with a fancy bottle of apple juice, water or wine???</td>', 'Photo conveys the theme well ... or does it?  Vegan, Health food, recent downsizing at work... more likey weight loss.  The can being the obtuse focal point within the s the photo is the give away for ''diet''... How it may have changed with a fancy bottle of apple juice, water or wine???', '2004-01-07 04:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
