(534277, 54043, 6132, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, nice use of colours, good job. Can''t think of too many Korn acoustic tunes though :o)</td>', 'Nice composition, nice use of colours, good job. Can''t think of too many Korn acoustic tunes though :o)', '2004-01-07 05:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(534279, 53490, 13759, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape! The purple sky is a result of post process or do you get it as is? Very impressive.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape! The purple sky is a result of post process or do you get it as is? Very impressive.', '2004-01-07 05:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(534280, 54104, 6132, '<td valign="top">Incredible composition and use of imagination. One of my faves for this challenge. Excellent job.</td>', 'Incredible composition and use of imagination. One of my faves for this challenge. Excellent job.', '2004-01-07 05:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(534283, 53865, 13759, '<td valign="top">The concept is nice. You use the flash to get it, but flash lit is even complex to use. It gives a color dither and subtle changes in tones. When using flash try to positionate it on an angle and distance that covers all subject. Prefer like you do, choose not straight angles.</td>', 'The concept is nice. You use the flash to get it, but flash lit is even complex to use. It gives a color dither and subtle changes in tones. When using flash try to positionate it on an angle and distance that covers all subject. Prefer like you do, choose not straight angles.', '2004-01-07 05:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(534286, 54080, 6132, '<td valign="top">I truly loved this picture. I think that any working parent with children can fully relate with this image. Nice composition and use of light. The only thing that I would have tried to change is the slight distraction in the upper right corner. Overall, good job, one of my faves for this contest, Good luck.</td>', 'I truly loved this picture. I think that any working parent with children can fully relate with this image. Nice composition and use of light. The only thing that I would have tried to change is the slight distraction in the upper right corner. Overall, good job, one of my faves for this contest, Good luck.', '2004-01-07 06:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(534287, 53874, 13759, '<td valign="top">Impressive skys. Very well choosed to represent beauty. This seems to be a bit color corrected. The orange tone is so intense.</td>', 'Impressive skys. Very well choosed to represent beauty. This seems to be a bit color corrected. The orange tone is so intense.', '2004-01-07 06:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
