(534296, 53717, 13759, '<td valign="top">It´s a nice shot. Very well choosed. While I was looking in I saw some things that distract me. I guess that it is intentional, but the wire, berrys and post are many points to give attention. Due to this I can´t find your principal subject. Guessing by the focus, the post is that subject, but I´m in doubt.</td>', 'It´s a nice shot. Very well choosed. While I was looking in I saw some things that distract me. I guess that it is intentional, but the wire, berrys and post are many points to give attention. Due to this I can´t find your principal subject. Guessing by the focus, the post is that subject, but I´m in doubt.', '2004-01-07 06:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
