(535410, 53434, 5822, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve lost too much detail on the left side although I know you''re trying to get a feeling of weight here. Also,  I don''t find the metal texture or color to be all that attractive.</td>', 'I think you''ve lost too much detail on the left side although I know you''re trying to get a feeling of weight here. Also,  I don''t find the metal texture or color to be all that attractive.', '2004-01-07 19:00:00.000000', NULL, 1);
