(535771, 53917, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wish you had zoomed in more to isolate the bird better to help eliminate and blur the distracting background.  Tone and color are really good, but the pic is a real stretch to meet the challenge theme.</td>', 'Wish you had zoomed in more to isolate the bird better to help eliminate and blur the distracting background.  Tone and color are really good, but the pic is a real stretch to meet the challenge theme.', '2004-01-07 23:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
