(535790, 54098, 5822, '<td valign="top">Outstanding capture to freeze the action!  Dynamic action shot. Like very much the way you''ve caught the biker so that he is in between the lights on the ceiling.  Image could use more contrast though and I wish you had zoomed in a bit more to show more detail.</td>', 'Outstanding capture to freeze the action!  Dynamic action shot. Like very much the way you''ve caught the biker so that he is in between the lights on the ceiling.  Image could use more contrast though and I wish you had zoomed in a bit more to show more detail.', '2004-01-08 00:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(535798, 53459, 15511, '<td valign="top">This is surreal. How''d ya do it?</td>', 'This is surreal. How''d ya do it?', '2004-01-08 00:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(535799, 53932, 5822, '<td valign="top">Outstanding photo. I love the colors and tones and the white snow-like capped waves that contrast so well with the darker sand.  Only the person way in the background is slightly distracting. Otherwise, perfect!</td>', 'Outstanding photo. I love the colors and tones and the white snow-like capped waves that contrast so well with the darker sand.  Only the person way in the background is slightly distracting. Otherwise, perfect!', '2004-01-08 00:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(535802, 54060, 5822, '<td valign="top">This shot is very well composed. I like how my eye is lead into the picture from the biz card to the man and then to the non-distracting background.  Colors are neutral and natural, and do not distract from the subject.  Only things I find to be somewhat bothersome is the cloud hovering over the guy''s head (minor) and the biz card is too bright.  Well done!</td>', 'This shot is very well composed. I like how my eye is lead into the picture from the biz card to the man and then to the non-distracting background.  Colors are neutral and natural, and do not distract from the subject.  Only things I find to be somewhat bothersome is the cloud hovering over the guy''s head (minor) and the biz card is too bright.  Well done!', '2004-01-08 00:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(535804, 53820, 15511, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit more color saturation?</td>', 'Perhaps a bit more color saturation?', '2004-01-08 00:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(535808, 53962, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette but horizon looks tilted.</td>', 'Nice silhouette but horizon looks tilted.', '2004-01-08 00:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
