(536039, 53459, 9941, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting, complicated shot.  Nice color too.</td>', 'This is an interesting, complicated shot.  Nice color too.', '2004-01-08 08:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(536040, 53843, 9941, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  The runner is obscured by the rock, should have been between the rocks.</td>', 'Good idea.  The runner is obscured by the rock, should have been between the rocks.', '2004-01-08 08:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(536041, 53641, 9941, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Try to be more creative and move away from "posed" studio-type shots.  Look for spontanioius things that no one else has seen.</td>', 'Nice image.  Try to be more creative and move away from "posed" studio-type shots.  Look for spontanioius things that no one else has seen.', '2004-01-08 08:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(536042, 53434, 9941, '<td valign="top">One of the better weight-lifting shots (there are at least 5 in this challenge).  I''m not excited about the background color, but the lighting is very nice.</td>', 'One of the better weight-lifting shots (there are at least 5 in this challenge).  I''m not excited about the background color, but the lighting is very nice.', '2004-01-08 08:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(536043, 53871, 9941, '<td valign="top">Good idea!  The photo is OK, but lacks drama.</td>', 'Good idea!  The photo is OK, but lacks drama.', '2004-01-08 08:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(536044, 54043, 9941, '<td valign="top">Good luck!  Playing a guitar is HARD but worth the effort.  Your photo is nice, but lacks drama.  Try to explore different angles and lighting to capture something that no one has ever seen.</td>', 'Good luck!  Playing a guitar is HARD but worth the effort.  Your photo is nice, but lacks drama.  Try to explore different angles and lighting to capture something that no one has ever seen.', '2004-01-08 08:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(536045, 54099, 9941, '<td valign="top">Awwww, such a cute shot.</td>', 'Awwww, such a cute shot.', '2004-01-08 08:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(536046, 53151, 9941, '<td valign="top">Nice job capturing something different in everyday stuff.</td>', 'Nice job capturing something different in everyday stuff.', '2004-01-08 08:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(536047, 53916, 9941, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the colors seem flat.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the colors seem flat.', '2004-01-08 08:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(536048, 53353, 9941, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting, unique shot.  You took the time to be creative and it shows.</td>', 'This is an interesting, unique shot.  You took the time to be creative and it shows.', '2004-01-08 08:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(536049, 53446, 9941, '<td valign="top">Nice vacation brochure shot.</td>', 'Nice vacation brochure shot.', '2004-01-08 08:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(536052, 54032, 9941, '<td valign="top">The perspective is perfect, and the image/title meet the challenge better than most in this competition.  Ribbon worthy!</td>', 'The perspective is perfect, and the image/title meet the challenge better than most in this competition.  Ribbon worthy!', '2004-01-08 08:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(536053, 53522, 9941, '<td valign="top">The first honest resolution!  Nice photo and interesting tones.</td>', 'The first honest resolution!  Nice photo and interesting tones.', '2004-01-08 08:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(536055, 53856, 9941, '<td valign="top">Nice, fun photograph.  It''s good to see something unique in a sky photo!</td>', 'Nice, fun photograph.  It''s good to see something unique in a sky photo!', '2004-01-08 08:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(536059, 53788, 11096, '<td valign="top">This is a good picture techically and it does meet the challenge.  But it is a bit boring.  White on white with just the bit of color in the vegtables makes me loose interest.  It looks like a stock magazine photo.  In my opinion it needs some more color somewhere such as a colored table cloth.  That would make the plate stand out more.</td>', 'This is a good picture techically and it does meet the challenge.  But it is a bit boring.  White on white with just the bit of color in the vegtables makes me loose interest.  It looks like a stock magazine photo.  In my opinion it needs some more color somewhere such as a colored table cloth.  That would make the plate stand out more.', '2004-01-08 08:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(536060, 53878, 11096, '<td valign="top">I am truly amazed with this picture.  I know the circumstances made it very difficult to get such a good picture.  It is so clear and detailed despite the awful lighting that is in the premi areas.  10</td>', 'I am truly amazed with this picture.  I know the circumstances made it very difficult to get such a good picture.  It is so clear and detailed despite the awful lighting that is in the premi areas.  10', '2004-01-08 08:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(536061, 53932, 11096, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture.  I like the way you caught the waves and the reflection of the sunset in the water.</td>', 'This is a great picture.  I like the way you caught the waves and the reflection of the sunset in the water.', '2004-01-08 08:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(536062, 53525, 11096, '<td valign="top">Great detail and color.  Those eyes are mesmerizing.</td>', 'Great detail and color.  Those eyes are mesmerizing.', '2004-01-08 08:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(536063, 53444, 11096, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a little bit out of focus and the colors could use some sharpening.  But it does meet the challenge</td>', 'Seems to be a little bit out of focus and the colors could use some sharpening.  But it does meet the challenge', '2004-01-08 08:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(536064, 53906, 11096, '<td valign="top">I think it is just a little bit oversharpened.  There are jpeg artifacts in it.  Maybe you could''ve used Neat Image to smooth it out a little.  Good idea and composition.</td>', 'I think it is just a little bit oversharpened.  There are jpeg artifacts in it.  Maybe you could''ve used Neat Image to smooth it out a little.  Good idea and composition.', '2004-01-08 08:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(536065, 54017, 11785, '<td valign="top">Soo sweet and good Title. Do you know him? - 10</td>', 'Soo sweet and good Title. Do you know him? - 10', '2004-01-08 09:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(536066, 53874, 11785, '<td valign="top">Very bad resolution :( Please take more pictures like that ant some funny too - 9</td>', 'Very bad resolution :( Please take more pictures like that ant some funny too - 9', '2004-01-08 09:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(536067, 53525, 11785, '<td valign="top">I do know those eyes and nose ... who you are :)<br/>Very good picture ! 9<br/>Lot of wise choises to you on 2004!</td>', 'I do know those eyes and nose ... who you are :)Very good picture ! 9Lot of wise choises to you on 2004!', '2004-01-08 09:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(536092, 54029, 15129, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture, but do you think maybe it should be mroe in focus and maybe croppsed a bit closer to the child and cat? Good luck</td>', 'This is a great picture, but do you think maybe it should be mroe in focus and maybe croppsed a bit closer to the child and cat? Good luck', '2004-01-08 09:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
