(536134, 53717, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty picture.  Very nice colors and DOF.  Love the red berries and your resolution!</td>', 'This is a very pretty picture.  Very nice colors and DOF.  Love the red berries and your resolution!', '2004-01-08 10:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(536136, 54085, 14620, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting and the composition of this picture.  Great colors, too.  Very nice!</td>', 'Love the lighting and the composition of this picture.  Great colors, too.  Very nice!', '2004-01-08 10:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(536138, 54013, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is a great Black on Black shot.  It''s very crisp and clean looking.  The starfish is a nice touch.  Well Done!</td>', 'This is a great Black on Black shot.  It''s very crisp and clean looking.  The starfish is a nice touch.  Well Done!', '2004-01-08 10:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(536139, 53845, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and lighting. Good title too.</td>', 'Very nice composition and lighting. Good title too.', '2004-01-08 10:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(536141, 54099, 15840, '<td valign="top">Sweetness in Pink !</td>', 'Sweetness in Pink !', '2004-01-08 10:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(536142, 53917, 14448, '<td valign="top">Striking image.  Technically fine.  Wish the big tree weren''t there, but roadkill happens where it happens I guess.  Extra point for making me double check the title and then laugh out loud!</td>', 'Striking image.  Technically fine.  Wish the big tree weren''t there, but roadkill happens where it happens I guess.  Extra point for making me double check the title and then laugh out loud!', '2004-01-08 10:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(536149, 53687, 5822, '<td valign="top">Perhaps less of a close up shot would have had more impact for me as the reflection of your surroundings in the sax is distracting. Also, the red/pinkish highlights seem "off."</td>', 'Perhaps less of a close up shot would have had more impact for me as the reflection of your surroundings in the sax is distracting. Also, the red/pinkish highlights seem "off."', '2004-01-08 10:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(536160, 53843, 14448, '<td valign="top">Nice colours,  tone and scenery.  Horizon not horizontal?  Wish the runner were closer.  Fits the theme.</td>', 'Nice colours,  tone and scenery.  Horizon not horizontal?  Wish the runner were closer.  Fits the theme.', '2004-01-08 10:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(536172, 53917, 15840, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I think I might have taken a little more of the tree out, but love the shot.</td>', 'Great shot. I think I might have taken a little more of the tree out, but love the shot.', '2004-01-08 10:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(536179, 53880, 14448, '<td valign="top">Great expression from the child.  Nice colours and tone.  Composition good, but wish the fisherman and branches in middle ground weren''t there of course, and I might have cropped it so she were 1/3 from the left rather than 1/4.  Illustrates the theme.</td>', 'Great expression from the child.  Nice colours and tone.  Composition good, but wish the fisherman and branches in middle ground weren''t there of course, and I might have cropped it so she were 1/3 from the left rather than 1/4.  Illustrates the theme.', '2004-01-08 10:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(536193, 54074, 11278, '<td valign="top">very well done.  i like the contrast of the dark smoke against the white background.</td>', 'very well done.  i like the contrast of the dark smoke against the white background.', '2004-01-08 11:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(536194, 54096, 5822, '<td valign="top">You certainly have your work cut out for you! Good contrast and very rich looking blacks, just the highlights in the upper left are blown out a bit too much, but not terribly so.  Composition is a little busy, but well designed.</td>', 'You certainly have your work cut out for you! Good contrast and very rich looking blacks, just the highlights in the upper left are blown out a bit too much, but not terribly so.  Composition is a little busy, but well designed.', '2004-01-08 11:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(536198, 53484, 11278, '<td valign="top">very creative and with an abstract feel.  i like this a lot.</td>', 'very creative and with an abstract feel.  i like this a lot.', '2004-01-08 11:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(536201, 53947, 11278, '<td valign="top">cute idea, and well done.  its doesnt depict a resolution, though.</td>', 'cute idea, and well done.  its doesnt depict a resolution, though.', '2004-01-08 11:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(536209, 53149, 11278, '<td valign="top">good illustration of this resolution, and a good ideal as well!</td>', 'good illustration of this resolution, and a good ideal as well!', '2004-01-08 11:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(536214, 54091, 5822, '<td valign="top">DOF is not deep enough to include the cigarette, which is an important element in this shot. Also, lighting seems uneven as evidenced by the fading of the printed message.</td>', 'DOF is not deep enough to include the cigarette, which is an important element in this shot. Also, lighting seems uneven as evidenced by the fading of the printed message.', '2004-01-08 11:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(536218, 54060, 11278, '<td valign="top">good luck with it!<br/>this is a good example of an environmental portrait.  you should use it in your advertising.  great use of dof.</td>', 'good luck with it!this is a good example of an environmental portrait.  you should use it in your advertising.  great use of dof.', '2004-01-08 11:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(536219, 53843, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great color but contrast is a bit too high as you''ve lost detail in the man. Should have exposed when runner was between rocks.  Also, horizon is not level.</td>', 'Great color but contrast is a bit too high as you''ve lost detail in the man. Should have exposed when runner was between rocks.  Also, horizon is not level.', '2004-01-08 11:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(536221, 54032, 14448, '<td valign="top">Outstanding colouring, nearly surreal.  Fine composition - background adds the interest that it would have lacked otherwise.  Maybe a little more contrast needed in the foreground - but I''m nitpicking.  A unique and very well executed variation of a cliche subject.  Really good job. 9</td>', 'Outstanding colouring, nearly surreal.  Fine composition - background adds the interest that it would have lacked otherwise.  Maybe a little more contrast needed in the foreground - but I''m nitpicking.  A unique and very well executed variation of a cliche subject.  Really good job. 9', '2004-01-08 11:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(536223, 54020, 11278, '<td valign="top">good luck!  i need to do that too.</td>', 'good luck!  i need to do that too.', '2004-01-08 11:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(536224, 53735, 14448, '<td valign="top">Fine technically and artistically.  The thematic expression pretty much eludes me though, sorry.</td>', 'Fine technically and artistically.  The thematic expression pretty much eludes me though, sorry.', '2004-01-08 11:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(536225, 53535, 15645, '<td valign="top">A flawless picture :)</td>', 'A flawless picture :)', '2004-01-08 11:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(536229, 53111, 14448, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Striking, provocative, haunting image.  Excellent tones.  Great composition and choice of DoF.  Were it not for the unfortunate horizontal line across the top, it would be a 10 instead of a 9 from me.  This image may stike different chords in others, but good art will always make an impact.  Bravo.</td>', 'Wow.  Striking, provocative, haunting image.  Excellent tones.  Great composition and choice of DoF.  Were it not for the unfortunate horizontal line across the top, it would be a 10 instead of a 9 from me.  This image may stike different chords in others, but good art will always make an impact.  Bravo.', '2004-01-08 11:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(536230, 53174, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great concept! I love the color against the backdrop of greytones, but the colors could have been more saturated. A bit dark in the leaves below.  Also, the glare above the upper right petal is distracting, as well as, the leaves in the upper right. I think many of your problems could have been avoided with softer light and better in-camera cropping. One more thing is the flower is too centered. Hope this was helpful and you didn''t find it too harsh of a critique.</td>', 'Great concept! I love the color against the backdrop of greytones, but the colors could have been more saturated. A bit dark in the leaves below.  Also, the glare above the upper right petal is distracting, as well as, the leaves in the upper right. I think many of your problems could have been avoided with softer light and better in-camera cropping. One more thing is the flower is too centered. Hope this was helpful and you didn''t find it too harsh of a critique.', '2004-01-08 11:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(536231, 53111, 11278, '<td valign="top">this is very bold and daring.  great resolution, and one that i should undertake as well.</td>', 'this is very bold and daring.  great resolution, and one that i should undertake as well.', '2004-01-08 11:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(536236, 54043, 5822, '<td valign="top">Lighting is nice and even, albeit a bit flat. Good color saturation and well exposed. Good luck.</td>', 'Lighting is nice and even, albeit a bit flat. Good color saturation and well exposed. Good luck.', '2004-01-08 11:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(536237, 53146, 15645, '<td valign="top">It focuses strangely, as if it was blurred extensively afterwards. Sorry if it wasn''t :)</td>', 'It focuses strangely, as if it was blurred extensively afterwards. Sorry if it wasn''t :)', '2004-01-08 11:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(536239, 54013, 14448, '<td valign="top">Technically and creatively excellent.  I like the solitary splash of colour and how the umbrella frame mirrors the shape of the starfish.  Clever and engaging expression of the theme.</td>', 'Technically and creatively excellent.  I like the solitary splash of colour and how the umbrella frame mirrors the shape of the starfish.  Clever and engaging expression of the theme.', '2004-01-08 11:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(536242, 54073, 14448, '<td valign="top">Technically and artistically excellent.  Creative expression of theme.  A tad literal and pandering for my taste though.</td>', 'Technically and artistically excellent.  Creative expression of theme.  A tad literal and pandering for my taste though.', '2004-01-08 11:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(536244, 53648, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like the way you cut off the rest of the room by blacing it out.</td>', 'Nice. I like the way you cut off the rest of the room by blacing it out.', '2004-01-08 11:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(536246, 53525, 15645, '<td valign="top">An extraordinary photo! Great job!</td>', 'An extraordinary photo! Great job!', '2004-01-08 11:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(536247, 53429, 11278, '<td valign="top">kind of humorous but it doesnt fit the challenge</td>', 'kind of humorous but it doesnt fit the challenge', '2004-01-08 11:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(536248, 53855, 14836, '<td valign="top">Very nice blues!</td>', 'Very nice blues!', '2004-01-08 11:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(536249, 53937, 15645, '<td valign="top">Nice eyes there.</td>', 'Nice eyes there.', '2004-01-08 11:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
