(536252, 53934, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice unfortunately a bit dark. A bit more lighting with have introduced more colors.</td>', 'Nice unfortunately a bit dark. A bit more lighting with have introduced more colors.', '2004-01-08 11:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
