(536316, 53111, 9295, '<td valign="top">I think one of the most important things about photography is being able to capture something to which others can relate.  Whether you are one battling weight (as this person is) or you have some other reason not to "love yourself", this photograph truly symbollizes your theme.  The photograph itself is technically sound, with the lighthing and black and white tones adding to the emotional response.  Very brave photograph.</td>', 'I think one of the most important things about photography is being able to capture something to which others can relate.  Whether you are one battling weight (as this person is) or you have some other reason not to "love yourself", this photograph truly symbollizes your theme.  The photograph itself is technically sound, with the lighthing and black and white tones adding to the emotional response.  Very brave photograph.', '2004-01-08 11:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(536319, 53145, 15840, '<td valign="top">Kick ass picture, but the title doesn''t fit it at all.</td>', 'Kick ass picture, but the title doesn''t fit it at all.', '2004-01-08 11:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(536322, 54075, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject matter that is a bit too small and dark. A little less sky and a bit more land would have exposed the structure better.  Either that, or use of a graduated neutral density filter would have been good too.</td>', 'Very interesting subject matter that is a bit too small and dark. A little less sky and a bit more land would have exposed the structure better.  Either that, or use of a graduated neutral density filter would have been good too.', '2004-01-08 11:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(536326, 53917, 9295, '<td valign="top">Hysterical!  I wish there was more definition between the scavanger''s head and the morsal upon which he is feasting, but the theme is so funny and entertaining, I gotta give you high marks just for making me giggle.  Atkins indeed!  LOL</td>', 'Hysterical!  I wish there was more definition between the scavanger''s head and the morsal upon which he is feasting, but the theme is so funny and entertaining, I gotta give you high marks just for making me giggle.  Atkins indeed!  LOL', '2004-01-08 12:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(536331, 53855, 9295, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph. Very calm and soothing, portrays your theme nicely.</td>', 'Beautiful photograph. Very calm and soothing, portrays your theme nicely.', '2004-01-08 12:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(536333, 53072, 5822, '<td valign="top">Would have had more impact if you had blurred the background.</td>', 'Would have had more impact if you had blurred the background.', '2004-01-08 12:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
