(536337, 53874, 9295, '<td valign="top">Nothing wrong with humor. It keeps us sane. That being said, this photo is a nice start to your resolution. The colors are wonderful. I particularly love how the blue sky can still be seen among all of these colors of the sunset(rise).</td>', 'Nothing wrong with humor. It keeps us sane. That being said, this photo is a nice start to your resolution. The colors are wonderful. I particularly love how the blue sky can still be seen among all of these colors of the sunset(rise).', '2004-01-08 12:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(536339, 53880, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait and lovely setting. Glad you didn''t blurr the background...they compliment each other so well.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait and lovely setting. Glad you didn''t blurr the background...they compliment each other so well.', '2004-01-08 12:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
