(536352, 53959, 9581, '<td valign="top">Great moon and timing of the plane shot! Its perfect!</td>', 'Great moon and timing of the plane shot! Its perfect!', '2004-01-08 12:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(536354, 54077, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very calming and serene shot, which the lighting in your shot adds to. I love the way your black clothes blends into the background and I think you should have taken more advantage of this. Specifically, the shot would have more impact for me had you been able to hide your feet or wear black sox so that they blended in with the black background as well. This would have created an effect of you floating and would have captured the essence of yoga, that being lightness of being and weightlessness. Very well done anyway. I like this photograph a lot.</td>', 'Very calming and serene shot, which the lighting in your shot adds to. I love the way your black clothes blends into the background and I think you should have taken more advantage of this. Specifically, the shot would have more impact for me had you been able to hide your feet or wear black sox so that they blended in with the black background as well. This would have created an effect of you floating and would have captured the essence of yoga, that being lightness of being and weightlessness. Very well done anyway. I like this photograph a lot.', '2004-01-08 12:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(536355, 53174, 15645, '<td valign="top">It''s truely amazing how the background looks like black&amp;white. Awesome photo!</td>', 'It''s truely amazing how the background looks like black&white. Awesome photo!', '2004-01-08 12:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
