(536953, 53731, 2223, '<td valign="top">Awesome! I could stare at this all night, but i have to get up for work in the morning. Did you use a tripod? there is a slight blur, but it dosn''t take anything away from the beauty of this. 10</td>', 'Awesome! I could stare at this all night, but i have to get up for work in the morning. Did you use a tripod? there is a slight blur, but it dosn''t take anything away from the beauty of this. 10', '2004-01-08 22:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
