(536965, 53179, 1670, '<td valign="top">I really like the setup for this shot. The colors contrast beautifully, and good overall focus. What I thought could be improved upon however was the lighting. The reflections off the coin were a bit distracting, and perhaps a stronger light/contrast could have drawn even more attention to the differences in color. Good job! I give this a 7. Improvement in lighting would move it up to an 8.</td>', 'I really like the setup for this shot. The colors contrast beautifully, and good overall focus. What I thought could be improved upon however was the lighting. The reflections off the coin were a bit distracting, and perhaps a stronger light/contrast could have drawn even more attention to the differences in color. Good job! I give this a 7. Improvement in lighting would move it up to an 8.', '2004-01-08 23:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(536966, 53917, 1670, '<td valign="top">Ah carrion. Excellent focus, interesting subject. The only thing this picture lacks is interest though. The subject is excellent, but the background takes away the majority of points from a perfect picture. I give this a 6, a change of background could of earned it upwards of a 9.</td>', 'Ah carrion. Excellent focus, interesting subject. The only thing this picture lacks is interest though. The subject is excellent, but the background takes away the majority of points from a perfect picture. I give this a 6, a change of background could of earned it upwards of a 9.', '2004-01-08 23:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(536979, 53899, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and interesting subject, but I wish your DOF was deeper so that both wings were in focus.</td>', 'Nice colors and interesting subject, but I wish your DOF was deeper so that both wings were in focus.', '2004-01-08 23:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(536983, 53818, 14448, '<td valign="top">Excellent colouring, light, contrast, texture.  We scuba divers prefer deeper water though :) so perhaps not the ideal image for expressing your resolution.</td>', 'Excellent colouring, light, contrast, texture.  We scuba divers prefer deeper water though :) so perhaps not the ideal image for expressing your resolution.', '2004-01-08 23:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
