(536991, 53865, 14448, '<td valign="top">I like your resolution, and this certainly illustrates it.  Main problem are distractions created by your lighting.  The on-camera flash created a very hot foreground, an unevenly lit background, and an unwanted shadows including the one behind your subject book.  Natural lighting might have worked better.</td>', 'I like your resolution, and this certainly illustrates it.  Main problem are distractions created by your lighting.  The on-camera flash created a very hot foreground, an unevenly lit background, and an unwanted shadows including the one behind your subject book.  Natural lighting might have worked better.', '2004-01-08 23:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(536992, 53930, 7908, '<td valign="top">Nice colors ... a little grainy though. Is it my imagination or is the horizon a little off?</td>', 'Nice colors ... a little grainy though. Is it my imagination or is the horizon a little off?', '2004-01-08 23:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
