(537023, 53855, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blue tones contrasting with the whites of the birds. You''ve also captured the texture of the wet sand so well. The only thing I think it lacks is a specific subject to focus on but still, very very well done. I love this photo!</td>', 'Beautiful blue tones contrasting with the whites of the birds. You''ve also captured the texture of the wet sand so well. The only thing I think it lacks is a specific subject to focus on but still, very very well done. I love this photo!', '2004-01-09 00:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
