(537292, 53993, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the metallic texture and the overall sharpness. Cutting off the edges of the weight creates an interesting composition with just a touch of tension. Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the metallic texture and the overall sharpness. Cutting off the edges of the weight creates an interesting composition with just a touch of tension. Nice shot.', '2004-01-09 11:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
