(538552, 53526, 12151, '<td valign="top">I would have really, really loved this photo if it were either clearer or if it were blurred more/posterized.  As it is, the image is in between perfectly clear and stylized, and it kinda bugs me...  Other than that, though, I really like the placement of the subject, the colors and lines - it\''s really striking.  Nice job.</td>', 'I would have really, really loved this photo if it were either clearer or if it were blurred more/posterized.  As it is, the image is in between perfectly clear and stylized, and it kinda bugs me...  Other than that, though, I really like the placement of the subject, the colors and lines - it\''s really striking.  Nice job.', '2004-01-11 02:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
