(538642, 53820, 3306, '<td valign="top">I understand how you feel. I don''t like cigarettes in my coffee either! Just kidding. Good set up and picture.</td>', 'I understand how you feel. I don''t like cigarettes in my coffee either! Just kidding. Good set up and picture.', '2004-01-11 05:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
