(539059, 53952, 12733, '<td valign="top">Good thought, but the highlights seem overexposed and the contrast is overpowering. This could be softer, and I''m not sure that a full ashtray really expresses the sense of a desire to quit.</td>', 'Good thought, but the highlights seem overexposed and the contrast is overpowering. This could be softer, and I''m not sure that a full ashtray really expresses the sense of a desire to quit.', '2004-01-11 20:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(539061, 53880, 12733, '<td valign="top">She certainly does look happy - we could all resolve to be this happy at least some of the time this year. I think the light on the girl is too bright, with the hot spots on her sweater, especially in contrast to the lower key lighting on the water.</td>', 'She certainly does look happy - we could all resolve to be this happy at least some of the time this year. I think the light on the girl is too bright, with the hot spots on her sweater, especially in contrast to the lower key lighting on the water.', '2004-01-11 20:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
