(539240, 53190, 13305, '<td valign="top">This isn''t exactly what I think of when I see "Feed the Hungry".   But I think your model is really good looking and the photo is well done.</td>', 'This isn''t exactly what I think of when I see "Feed the Hungry".   But I think your model is really good looking and the photo is well done.', '2004-01-12 00:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(539256, 53731, 5822, '<td valign="top">Sky colors are great and very vivid, but I find the silhouetted house and plants to be ugly and out of place.</td>', 'Sky colors are great and very vivid, but I find the silhouetted house and plants to be ugly and out of place.', '2004-01-12 01:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(539266, 53490, 5822, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve already accomplished your goal...you''ve not only seen beauty in this image, but you''ve made it beautiful as well. I love the tones of the water and land, as well as, the mist, which make it a moody shot.  I would like to point out some things that I think could use improving. First, I think the sky is way too bright. Had you considered using a graduated ND filter? Or maybe placing the horizon higher so that there would be less sky?  Secondly, the sky''s color looks a bit unnatural to me...too purplish. Did you add that in your post processing? Finally, the structure is too dark. Other than that, I love this photo.</td>', 'I think you''ve already accomplished your goal...you''ve not only seen beauty in this image, but you''ve made it beautiful as well. I love the tones of the water and land, as well as, the mist, which make it a moody shot.  I would like to point out some things that I think could use improving. First, I think the sky is way too bright. Had you considered using a graduated ND filter? Or maybe placing the horizon higher so that there would be less sky?  Secondly, the sky''s color looks a bit unnatural to me...too purplish. Did you add that in your post processing? Finally, the structure is too dark. Other than that, I love this photo.', '2004-01-12 01:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(539272, 53648, 5822, '<td valign="top">His back is blown out and you''ve lost detail where it''s needed most. Would have liked to have seen some muscle definition to emphasize the exercising.</td>', 'His back is blown out and you''ve lost detail where it''s needed most. Would have liked to have seen some muscle definition to emphasize the exercising.', '2004-01-12 01:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(539383, 53886, 4517, '<td valign="top">Ouch</td>', 'Ouch', '2004-01-12 06:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(539384, 54065, 4517, '<td valign="top">Nothing fails like prayer :)</td>', 'Nothing fails like prayer :)', '2004-01-12 06:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(539432, 53174, 15756, '<td valign="top">Effect is totally awesome!!!!</td>', 'Effect is totally awesome!!!!', '2004-01-12 08:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(539433, 53934, 13305, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a bad photo,  but next time go ahead and use the full 150K allowed.  The size can also be up to 640px on the longest side, making it easier to see.</td>', 'This isn''t a bad photo,  but next time go ahead and use the full 150K allowed.  The size can also be up to 640px on the longest side, making it easier to see.', '2004-01-12 08:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(539434, 53715, 15756, '<td valign="top">Nice!!!!!  Black and white effect really clears the pic!</td>', 'Nice!!!!!  Black and white effect really clears the pic!', '2004-01-12 08:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(539436, 53940, 15756, '<td valign="top">Wow!!!!  Incredibly nice ice pic!</td>', 'Wow!!!!  Incredibly nice ice pic!', '2004-01-12 08:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(539438, 53434, 15756, '<td valign="top">Love the old weight! Ligthing is simply perfect!</td>', 'Love the old weight! Ligthing is simply perfect!', '2004-01-12 08:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(539440, 53535, 13305, '<td valign="top">Filling the frame is ok, but I think the image would have more impact if you backed off a bit more and/or had a little more contrast.  The red of the bloom is overpowering.</td>', 'Filling the frame is ok, but I think the image would have more impact if you backed off a bit more and/or had a little more contrast.  The red of the bloom is overpowering.', '2004-01-12 08:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(539442, 53718, 15756, '<td valign="top">Sun effect really makes it perfect!</td>', 'Sun effect really makes it perfect!', '2004-01-12 08:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(539444, 53872, 15756, '<td valign="top">Yep! That i''d do to... except here... were up to 3 feets :)</td>', 'Yep! That i''d do to... except here... were up to 3 feets :)', '2004-01-12 08:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(539452, 54074, 15834, '<td valign="top">Although a dirty subject, this photo is quite pleasant ;-) The graceful ribbons of smoke gives it a relaxing and soothing feel. Nice job!</td>', 'Although a dirty subject, this photo is quite pleasant ;-) The graceful ribbons of smoke gives it a relaxing and soothing feel. Nice job!', '2004-01-12 08:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(539455, 53949, 15756, '<td valign="top">Very Nice!</td>', 'Very Nice!', '2004-01-12 08:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(539457, 53111, 15834, '<td valign="top">The subject of this photo (to love myself) is unique amongst the other entries. I like it! It does well in B&amp;W- it describes the reality without too much detail. The angle shows an unflattering view, but really makes the viewer understand the meaning of the photo. Nice balance of shadows and highlights. Excellent!</td>', 'The subject of this photo (to love myself) is unique amongst the other entries. I like it! It does well in B&W- it describes the reality without too much detail. The angle shows an unflattering view, but really makes the viewer understand the meaning of the photo. Nice balance of shadows and highlights. Excellent!', '2004-01-12 08:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(539500, 53717, 8682, '<td valign="top">Beatiful and original image. Good focus.</td>', 'Beatiful and original image. Good focus.', '2004-01-12 09:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(539538, 53459, 14729, '<td valign="top">Briliant idea with good skills. I like it a lot....</td>', 'Briliant idea with good skills. I like it a lot....', '2004-01-12 10:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(539679, 54046, 13305, '<td valign="top">I think this image would have more impact in color.</td>', 'I think this image would have more impact in color.', '2004-01-12 11:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(539819, 53855, 15834, '<td valign="top">I feel like resting already! This feels soothing and peaceful. Nice photo.<br/> <br/>The top left seems out of focus. That''s okay since my eyes are drawn to the center.</td>', 'I feel like resting already! This feels soothing and peaceful. Nice photo. The top left seems out of focus. That''s okay since my eyes are drawn to the center.', '2004-01-12 13:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(539823, 53788, 15834, '<td valign="top">Simple, beautiful, and horrible :-) I''d had to start a diet with THAT in mind! A nice, clear photo. Perhaps a little too long in shadow, but it''s a good pic.</td>', 'Simple, beautiful, and horrible :-) I''d had to start a diet with THAT in mind! A nice, clear photo. Perhaps a little too long in shadow, but it''s a good pic.', '2004-01-12 13:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(539831, 53254, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like the topic and the Psalm you choose. Awsome idea. yelloow is kindof a wierd tone though. 9</td>', 'I like the topic and the Psalm you choose. Awsome idea. yelloow is kindof a wierd tone though. 9', '2004-01-12 13:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(539832, 54081, 15834, '<td valign="top">I like this as a resolution. The photo tells me to be "flexible" but also strong- as a tree stands up to the elements. Cropping is a little too tight. Perhaps it would be good to see the top of the middle tree. Also, it would be good to have something else in view to give the photo more depth.</td>', 'I like this as a resolution. The photo tells me to be "flexible" but also strong- as a tree stands up to the elements. Cropping is a little too tight. Perhaps it would be good to see the top of the middle tree. Also, it would be good to have something else in view to give the photo more depth.', '2004-01-12 13:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(539839, 54005, 15834, '<td valign="top">Forground is a little out of focus. The kid''s face could use a little more light. The photo is kind of top-heavy. It does give me a good image of concentration and "studying hard". Nice!</td>', 'Forground is a little out of focus. The kid''s face could use a little more light. The photo is kind of top-heavy. It does give me a good image of concentration and "studying hard". Nice!', '2004-01-12 13:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(539842, 53735, 15834, '<td valign="top">As a resolution, the light seems a bit dull. But I really like the photo! It has a nice, warm glow. Makes me feel comfortable. Nice!</td>', 'As a resolution, the light seems a bit dull. But I really like the photo! It has a nice, warm glow. Makes me feel comfortable. Nice!', '2004-01-12 13:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(539849, 53932, 15834, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! A wonderful sunset. Definitely a "reminder" for the good side of life. Nice colors and great contrast.</td>', 'Beautiful! A wonderful sunset. Definitely a "reminder" for the good side of life. Nice colors and great contrast.', '2004-01-12 13:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(539857, 53149, 15834, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! The colors are vivid and beautiful. The top seems distorted or out of focus or something. Perhaps its too much compression with the jpg? I dunno. But it''s a nice photo.</td>', 'Nice shot! The colors are vivid and beautiful. The top seems distorted or out of focus or something. Perhaps its too much compression with the jpg? I dunno. But it''s a nice photo.', '2004-01-12 13:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(539861, 53179, 15834, '<td valign="top">If you''re only gambling with cents then I guess it''s not all that bad :-) Nice detail and focus.</td>', 'If you''re only gambling with cents then I guess it''s not all that bad :-) Nice detail and focus.', '2004-01-12 13:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(539866, 53965, 15834, '<td valign="top">Nice photo and subject. But I think the flash (I''m guessing- perhaps some other source of white light?) makes it a little too harsh. If the light was more subdued and warmer, I think it would make a better photo. Also, cropping some of the right side out would better, I think. There''s too much tub and bubbles.</td>', 'Nice photo and subject. But I think the flash (I''m guessing- perhaps some other source of white light?) makes it a little too harsh. If the light was more subdued and warmer, I think it would make a better photo. Also, cropping some of the right side out would better, I think. There''s too much tub and bubbles.', '2004-01-12 13:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(539867, 54077, 15834, '<td valign="top">Her expression is perfect- makes me feel relaxed. Nice!</td>', 'Her expression is perfect- makes me feel relaxed. Nice!', '2004-01-12 13:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(539876, 54102, 15834, '<td valign="top">The composition is nice to me. Good focus and detail.<br/> <br/>Good luck with the double integrals! :-)</td>', 'The composition is nice to me. Good focus and detail. Good luck with the double integrals! :-)', '2004-01-12 13:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(539883, 53274, 15834, '<td valign="top">The bird is beautiful, but this photo is a little too busy. Also, the bright sky is distracting- it bleeds through the foliage so the bright green isn''t as enjoyable as it could be.</td>', 'The bird is beautiful, but this photo is a little too busy. Also, the bright sky is distracting- it bleeds through the foliage so the bright green isn''t as enjoyable as it could be.', '2004-01-12 13:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(539889, 54079, 15834, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice image of a little secret no one else can see. Great photo, butt perhaps the hand could be just a little bit lower to help balance things out. Just my opinion :-)</td>', 'It''s a nice image of a little secret no one else can see. Great photo, butt perhaps the hand could be just a little bit lower to help balance things out. Just my opinion :-)', '2004-01-12 13:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(539909, 53459, 10546, '<td valign="top">This is probably  the winner, but I find the display on the top to be a bit distracting. Hope that it has something to do with the picture and doesn\''t turn out to be just a bit of uncropped image.<br/> <br/>... and really would like to know how it was done. Bravo!</td>', 'This is probably  the winner, but I find the display on the top to be a bit distracting. Hope that it has something to do with the picture and doesn\''t turn out to be just a bit of uncropped image. ... and really would like to know how it was done. Bravo!', '2004-01-12 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(539974, 53679, 12151, '<td valign="top">That littl ebit of color adds a lot of effect on your photo.</td>', 'That littl ebit of color adds a lot of effect on your photo.', '2004-01-12 14:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(539975, 53985, 12151, '<td valign="top">Interesting setup and image, but the darkness on the right makes the photo have more of a mood of horror than anything else.</td>', 'Interesting setup and image, but the darkness on the right makes the photo have more of a mood of horror than anything else.', '2004-01-12 14:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(540038, 53940, 13136, '<td valign="top">What''s wrong with color. You don''t need a lot with this shot. Very nice. one of the best.</td>', 'What''s wrong with color. You don''t need a lot with this shot. Very nice. one of the best.', '2004-01-12 15:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(540077, 53165, 16052, '<td valign="top">Great composition and color.</td>', 'Great composition and color.', '2004-01-12 16:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
