(540117, 54032, 13487, '<td valign="top">Sounds like a good resolution.  I think the border is a great accent to the photo... very nice photo.</td>', 'Sounds like a good resolution.  I think the border is a great accent to the photo... very nice photo.', '2004-01-12 16:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
