(541096, 53641, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus and detail.  I''m sure some will say that they wish there were more light, but I think that''s what I like.  the background is perfect, nothing distracting there, and I like the setup as well.  Looks yummy to me!  I like the darkness about this shot.  Very nice. ~Heather~</td>', 'Very nice focus and detail.  I''m sure some will say that they wish there were more light, but I think that''s what I like.  the background is perfect, nothing distracting there, and I like the setup as well.  Looks yummy to me!  I like the darkness about this shot.  Very nice. ~Heather~', '2004-01-13 12:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(541099, 53940, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I love how the light reflects on the forground.  The silhouetted background is also very pretty.  This only seems to fit in with the challenge because of the title, but oh well.  I think this was a hard challenge.  Overall this is really beautiful. ~Heather~</td>', 'Very pretty.  I love how the light reflects on the forground.  The silhouetted background is also very pretty.  This only seems to fit in with the challenge because of the title, but oh well.  I think this was a hard challenge.  Overall this is really beautiful. ~Heather~', '2004-01-13 12:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(541103, 53824, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is really nit-picky, but the diagonal line toward the left side of the photo kind of bothers me.  I''m wondering if it''s because it isn''t symetrical with the one on the left.  The main subject of the photo is nice, and does make sense with your title to fit into the challenge well.  An interesting twist to use candy for the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'This is really nit-picky, but the diagonal line toward the left side of the photo kind of bothers me.  I''m wondering if it''s because it isn''t symetrical with the one on the left.  The main subject of the photo is nice, and does make sense with your title to fit into the challenge well.  An interesting twist to use candy for the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-01-13 12:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(541104, 54024, 3080, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, but without the title, I don''t see how it fits into the challenge.  I do like the lights, and the colors are good.  I wonder though if playing with the saturation would bring out the colors even more.</td>', 'Interesting photo, but without the title, I don''t see how it fits into the challenge.  I do like the lights, and the colors are good.  I wonder though if playing with the saturation would bring out the colors even more.', '2004-01-13 13:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
