(541112, 54081, 3080, '<td valign="top">A dead looking tree on a bland background honestly doesn''t appeal much to me.  However, your focus is good.  Usually trees with lots of branches look blurry, this does not.  Also, without the title, it doesn''t connect well with the challenge.  However, with the title, I think it does well.  ~Heather~</td>', 'A dead looking tree on a bland background honestly doesn''t appeal much to me.  However, your focus is good.  Usually trees with lots of branches look blurry, this does not.  Also, without the title, it doesn''t connect well with the challenge.  However, with the title, I think it does well.  ~Heather~', '2004-01-13 13:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(541113, 54046, 3080, '<td valign="top">Well, focus is good.  You got a lot of different textures in the shot.  Your shirt, fingers, and the condom.  The shadow from the condom though is distracting to me.  Bad lighting.  Cood connection to the challenge in my opinion.  Not what I want to hang on my wall or anything, but good idea. ~Heather~</td>', 'Well, focus is good.  You got a lot of different textures in the shot.  Your shirt, fingers, and the condom.  The shadow from the condom though is distracting to me.  Bad lighting.  Cood connection to the challenge in my opinion.  Not what I want to hang on my wall or anything, but good idea. ~Heather~', '2004-01-13 13:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(541118, 54059, 3080, '<td valign="top">The lighting confuses me.  It''s really dark on the subject, but there is a bright reflection on the bottom area of the guitar.  I wish the lighting were brighter on the boy and guitar, but not with bright areas.  If that makes sense.  The background is good.  Nothing distracting there.  Good idea for the challenge, just wish it weren''t so dark. ~Heather~</td>', 'The lighting confuses me.  It''s really dark on the subject, but there is a bright reflection on the bottom area of the guitar.  I wish the lighting were brighter on the boy and guitar, but not with bright areas.  If that makes sense.  The background is good.  Nothing distracting there.  Good idea for the challenge, just wish it weren''t so dark. ~Heather~', '2004-01-13 13:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
