(541126, 53353, 3080, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I''d have guessed this to be "To have more patience".  I think this does fit into the challenge well, unlike a lot of shots that I''ve seen so far.  your focus and clarity are good, and the angle and framing/cropping are good too in my opinion.  I like the symetry at the top.  It''s not perfectly symetrical, however, lined up really well.  Overall a great shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'Without the title, I''d have guessed this to be "To have more patience".  I think this does fit into the challenge well, unlike a lot of shots that I''ve seen so far.  your focus and clarity are good, and the angle and framing/cropping are good too in my opinion.  I like the symetry at the top.  It''s not perfectly symetrical, however, lined up really well.  Overall a great shot. ~Heather~', '2004-01-13 13:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
