(541130, 53446, 3080, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I would have guessed this to be "relax more".  It''s a very nice photo, and fits the challenge well.  I think the colors are great.  I especially like the positioning of the chairs within the frame of the photo. It''s good to not see them in the center of the photo.  Makes it much more interesting to have them off center. ~Heather~  Great shot.</td>', 'Without the title, I would have guessed this to be "relax more".  It''s a very nice photo, and fits the challenge well.  I think the colors are great.  I especially like the positioning of the chairs within the frame of the photo. It''s good to not see them in the center of the photo.  Makes it much more interesting to have them off center. ~Heather~  Great shot.', '2004-01-13 13:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
