(541645, 53459, 2333, '<td valign="top">Well-deserved ribbon... you sure went to alot of work to get this one! Your story is a hoot.</td>', 'Well-deserved ribbon... you sure went to alot of work to get this one! Your story is a hoot.', '2004-01-14 00:07:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(541646, 53917, 9932, '<td valign="top">Nice work!<br/>But I think you grossed them out this time :(</td>', 'Nice work!But I think you grossed them out this time :(', '2004-01-14 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(541648, 53905, 12712, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  Now that I look back at it, I could have cropped a nice amount.  It was taken in TX, where my parents live, I was down there for winter break.  This is my nephew, my older sister was also down there for the holidays.  The picture wasn''t planned at all.  This was in the afternoon, he just went to the backyard, and put on my younger sisters skanes.  He tried to walk with them on in the grass, and he fell, thats when I took the picture.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  Now that I look back at it, I could have cropped a nice amount.  It was taken in TX, where my parents live, I was down there for winter break.  This is my nephew, my older sister was also down there for the holidays.  The picture wasn''t planned at all.  This was in the afternoon, he just went to the backyard, and put on my younger sisters skanes.  He tried to walk with them on in the grass, and he fell, thats when I took the picture.', '2004-01-14 00:09:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(541650, 54032, 5044, '<td valign="top">Well done, beautiful image.  Congratulations!</td>', 'Well done, beautiful image.  Congratulations!', '2004-01-14 00:09:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(541656, 53459, 5044, '<td valign="top">Wow! Congratulations. Never mind that the picture is AWESOME, you deserve the ribbon just for the setup. Damn! Now that''s dedication to your craft. Well done, and very well deserved.</td>', 'Wow! Congratulations. Never mind that the picture is AWESOME, you deserve the ribbon just for the setup. Damn! Now that''s dedication to your craft. Well done, and very well deserved.', '2004-01-14 00:14:42.000000', NULL, 0),
