(541691, 53525, 2333, '<td valign="top">Congrats, great shot, especially under the time pressure. Well deserved ribbon.</td>', 'Congrats, great shot, especially under the time pressure. Well deserved ribbon.', '2004-01-14 00:36:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(541713, 53940, 5044, '<td valign="top">Wow! Never did I expect to see myself here in 4th! I thought people might not get my new dark view on things, but perhaps i''m on to something. Anyhow, a good start to the new year. Thanks to all that commented!<br/> <br/>In hindsight, I probably could have pulled this image off without all the post processing. Somehow, I started in one direction, and just kept going, and going. I now look back and take my original image and see that I problably could have accomplished the same, or better, results without all the processing. <br/> <br/>Mario</td>', 'Wow! Never did I expect to see myself here in 4th! I thought people might not get my new dark view on things, but perhaps i''m on to something. Anyhow, a good start to the new year. Thanks to all that commented! In hindsight, I probably could have pulled this image off without all the post processing. Somehow, I started in one direction, and just kept going, and going. I now look back and take my original image and see that I problably could have accomplished the same, or better, results without all the processing.  Mario', '2004-01-14 00:48:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(541770, 54104, 5822, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 10 and am also surprised at your finish. I found this shot to be creative, original, unique and striking and you just taught me a thing or two about post-processing manipulation. Congratulations on a photo very well done.</td>', 'I gave you a 10 and am also surprised at your finish. I found this shot to be creative, original, unique and striking and you just taught me a thing or two about post-processing manipulation. Congratulations on a photo very well done.', '2004-01-14 01:14:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(541800, 53459, 12160, '<td valign="top">A lot of thoughts and work put into this. Well worth it. Love that race against time to get the perfect lighting. Congrats!</td>', 'A lot of thoughts and work put into this. Well worth it. Love that race against time to get the perfect lighting. Congrats!', '2004-01-14 01:28:19.000000', NULL, 0),
