(541824, 53459, 12962, '<td valign="top">I admire your vision, patience and tenacity.  And of course the wonderful result of a job well done.  You''ve captured your scene in the perfect light possible.</td>', 'I admire your vision, patience and tenacity.  And of course the wonderful result of a job well done.  You''ve captured your scene in the perfect light possible.', '2004-01-14 01:39:17.000000', NULL, 0),
