(541961, 53863, 9809, '<td valign="top">I think you would have done much better with a different title. Unfortunately, we cannot see your comments until after the challenge is over. A title like "Leave the cold weather behind" would have ranked you a lot higher in the challenge. Looking at all the comments, including mine, I see the basic problem was, no one saw this as a new year''s resolution, but leaving the cold weather behind, or "move to where it is warm" or some title showing how this photo relates to a resolution for change.</td>', 'I think you would have done much better with a different title. Unfortunately, we cannot see your comments until after the challenge is over. A title like "Leave the cold weather behind" would have ranked you a lot higher in the challenge. Looking at all the comments, including mine, I see the basic problem was, no one saw this as a new year''s resolution, but leaving the cold weather behind, or "move to where it is warm" or some title showing how this photo relates to a resolution for change.', '2004-01-14 05:34:40.000000', NULL, 0),
