(542031, 54056, 10858, '<td valign="top">lockjawdavis: you can photograph text, you just can''t add it after the photo comes out of camera IMHO.<br/> <br/>Réka: Oh, yes, én meg azt fogadtam meg, hogy csak akkor nevezek, ha 5 feletti átlagra van esélyem. Pont ezen a futamo nel is csúsztam rajta. :-) Tetszik az elrendezés és nagyon szép éles kép! És már megint nem volt idõm kommentelni a futam ideje alatt... Pedig ez tetsziiik! :-)</td>', 'lockjawdavis: you can photograph text, you just can''t add it after the photo comes out of camera IMHO. Réka: Oh, yes, én meg azt fogadtam meg, hogy csak akkor nevezek, ha 5 feletti átlagra van esélyem. Pont ezen a futamo nel is csúsztam rajta. :-) Tetszik az elrendezés és nagyon szép éles kép! És már megint nem volt idõm kommentelni a futam ideje alatt... Pedig ez tetsziiik! :-)', '2004-01-14 07:08:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(542041, 53855, 14790, '<td valign="top">The geese were on ice on a small lake.  I colored it  bluish in P.S. to make it a different look.  300mm with 2x converter, birds were approx. 200 yards.  Thanks for the kind remarks and reviews.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-01-14 07:21:11.</i></td>', 'The geese were on ice on a small lake.  I colored it  bluish in P.S. to make it a different look.  300mm with 2x converter, birds were approx. 200 yards.  Thanks for the kind remarks and reviews.', '2004-01-14 07:20:28.000000', '2004-01-14 07:21:11.000000', 0),
(542045, 53358, 10858, '<td valign="top">Thank you for your comments. :-)<br/> <br/>bcvieira: I was thinking about whether I should check your comment as helpful or not, because you can read that I have been thinking about it before (photographer''s comment). To tell the truth I had so many packages with me, that last thing I wished to carry was a 1.5 meter high Edixa tripod I have at home... So I was just elbowing in the window. :-) As you see, the building is okay. It really looks like this in real life (four windows, then a higher thing for staircases,...).</td>', 'Thank you for your comments. :-) bcvieira: I was thinking about whether I should check your comment as helpful or not, because you can read that I have been thinking about it before (photographer''s comment). To tell the truth I had so many packages with me, that last thing I wished to carry was a 1.5 meter high Edixa tripod I have at home... So I was just elbowing in the window. :-) As you see, the building is okay. It really looks like this in real life (four windows, then a higher thing for staircases,...).', '2004-01-14 07:23:28.000000', NULL, 0),
