(542186, 54058, 15407, '<td valign="top">Thank You for the positive feedback.  I''m pleased with the votes you gave me.  Oddly I voted 14 pictures higher than mine that finished lower and I voted 14 pictures lower than mine that finished higher.... Go figure.  I plan on posting a ''repaired'' version of this picture in my portfolio.<br/>Best Regards <br/>Tim<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-01-20 11:04:32.</i></td>', 'Thank You for the positive feedback.  I''m pleased with the votes you gave me.  Oddly I voted 14 pictures higher than mine that finished lower and I voted 14 pictures lower than mine that finished higher.... Go figure.  I plan on posting a ''repaired'' version of this picture in my portfolio.Best Regards Tim', '2004-01-14 09:04:05.000000', '2004-01-20 11:04:32.000000', 0),
