(542927, 53525, 3306, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for your great comments and critiques. I really appreciate the time you take to give me your input. I considered this a very lucky capture. Normally it takes me many, many takes to get one I like. Maybe I should keep my eyes closed more often when I shoot!:) Thanks again, Larry</td>', 'Thanks to everyone for your great comments and critiques. I really appreciate the time you take to give me your input. I considered this a very lucky capture. Normally it takes me many, many takes to get one I like. Maybe I should keep my eyes closed more often when I shoot!:) Thanks again, Larry', '2004-01-14 14:02:57.000000', NULL, 0),
