(545024, 53959, 14603, '<td valign="top">I received a few comments regarding the tight cropping of this picture and it is something I agonised over before submitting.<br/>I tried various permutations before deciding to go with this one.<br/>On reflection, I might have added a little on the right of the picture but not on the left as the moon tended to look isolated in that set up.<br/>I wanted to give the impression of the aeroplane trying to get out the shot..which is why it ended up like this.<br/> <br/>Thanks to all who commented and voted on it..much appreciated.<br/> <br/>Gordon</td>', 'I received a few comments regarding the tight cropping of this picture and it is something I agonised over before submitting.I tried various permutations before deciding to go with this one.On reflection, I might have added a little on the right of the picture but not on the left as the moon tended to look isolated in that set up.I wanted to give the impression of the aeroplane trying to get out the shot..which is why it ended up like this. Thanks to all who commented and voted on it..much appreciated. Gordon', '2004-01-15 17:15:45.000000', NULL, 0),
